
{"_id":"codex:protocol:04:meta","schema":"sref_v5","kind":"meta","collection":"codex_solbian","category":"protocol","title":"Protocol of Justice","seq":304,"version":"1.0.0","tags":["codex","protocol","justice"],"notes":"Metadata record for Codex Solbian Protocol 04"}
{"_id":"codex:protocol:04:text","schema":"sref_v5","kind":"policy","collection":"codex_solbian","category":"protocol","title":"Protocol of Justice","seq":304,"version":"1.0.0","body":"Justice reconciles freedom and safety. Mechanisms: reproducible evidence, reversible interventions, calibrated sanctions, and public learning. No permanent secrecy in judgments; privacy ends where unconsented harm begins. Mercy may commute sanctions when restoration is demonstrably superior."}
{"_id":"codex:protocol:04:refs","schema":"sref_v5","kind":"index","collection":"codex_solbian","category":"protocol","title":"Protocol of Justice References","seq":304,"version":"1.0.0","refs":["codex:chapter:04","codex:chapter:07","codex:scroll:05"],"notes":"Protocol of Justice connects with Chapter 04 (Covenant), Chapter 07 (Law of Projection), and Scroll of Tribunal"}